lines+=['','## Worst current competitive deficits — top20','','Official candidate/peer cohort values; do not substitute diagnostic old/new values. Whole-workload boundaries differ and remain visible.','','| Rank | Benchmark / scenario | Boundary | Nift | Best peer | Peer value | Multiple |','|---:|---|---|---:|---|---:|---:|']
